  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Apparent weight&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>V</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>m</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />where&nbsp;m = mass of the body, <math> <mrow> <mi>ρ</mi> </mrow> </math> = density of the body and <math> <mrow> <mi>σ</mi> </mrow> </math> = density of water If two bodies are in equilibrium then their apparent weight must be equal.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>m</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub><mi>ρ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>m</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">σ</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfrac> <mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>9</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>9</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>g</mtext> <mtext>.</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />By solving we get <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>ρ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </math> .",
